      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp01_select_03",
      "hash64": "67D9CAAFB68E3385",
      "text": "校长",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "8F15FDF6083A847F",
      "text": "人工巨蛋中有４个区域～！？\\n哦～怎么回事？太厉害了！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "5CE2A60FFB6E7D47",
      "text": "在学园中举办的模拟联盟！？\\n虽然有点正经，但挺不错嘛！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp01_04c",
      "hash64": "5CE2A50FFB6E7B94",
      "text": "校……校长？听上去好无……\\n好让人不安，真的没问题吗？\\c\\n如果请了个没个性的嘉宾上节目，\\n那可真的会出事的……[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "8F15FCF6083A82CC",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n感谢你提供题材～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
