      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "7952C98D39B8F874",
      "text": "用电网捕获你的眼球！\\n谁来奇述？奇树来了～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
