          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "B34D956F0D34F73C",
      "text": "我交换给你的小磁怪的近况\\n让人好奇啊！？\\c\\n这孩子能够使用电网，\\n超有人气的哦～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
